WEBVTT

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.226
All of a sudden --

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.309
(sings) I didn't think
ballet was dumb anymore.

00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:05.083
(Laughter)

00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:10.934
You see, what I know now
is Miss Ann was fully aware

00:08:10.958 --> 00:08:15.768
that the white ballet schools
would not accept Black girls.

00:08:15.792 --> 00:08:18.268
She was incensed by that.

00:08:18.292 --> 00:08:20.809
So she came to the Black neighborhood

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:24.000
to start teaching
the dance classes herself.

00:08:24.958 --> 00:08:28.059
And you know, it took love
and courage for her to do that.

00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:31.083
(Applause)